     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Threads: 3  Questions: 240484138  Slow queries: 4  Opens: 48  Flush tables: 1  Open tables: 41  Queries per second avg: 30.663",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "--------------\n",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "we only discovered this when trying to ingest a Dublin Core datastream which had the ŷ character in them and we got the following error:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Caused by: java.sql.SQLException: Incorrect string value: '\\xC5\\xB7... ...' for column 'dcDescription' at row 1",
